    title: "A Sneak Peek Inside a High-Performing Google Ads Strategy",
    metaTitle: "Inside a High-Performing Google Ads Strategy",
    excerpt: "The core structure behind Google Ads campaigns that consistently produce a strong cost per booked job for service businesses.",
